<rss xmlns:chr2="https://cyberheatradar.github.io/cyber-heat-radar-2/ns/rss/v1" version="2.0"><channel><title>Cyber Heat Radar 2 | Latest Articles</title><link>https://cyberheatradar.github.io/cyber-heat-radar-2/</link><description>Newly observed cybersecurity articles from NEWS, Zenn, Qiita and Medium.</description><language>ja-JP</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:12:21 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>60</ttl><chr2:windowStartJST>2026-11-27T12:00:00+09:00</chr2:windowStartJST><chr2:windowEndJST>2026-11-27T13:00:00+09:00</chr2:windowEndJST><chr2:publicationSlotJST>2026-11-27T13:00:00+09:00</chr2:publicationSlotJST><chr2:generatedAtJST>2026-11-27T13:12:21.783363+09:00</chr2:generatedAtJST><chr2:itemCount>17</chr2:itemCount><item><title>How to Break Into Cybersecurity in 2027: The Realistic Roadmap Nobody Talks About</title><link>https://medium.com/@saifkhantoru/how-to-break-into-cybersecurity-in-2027-the-realistic-roadmap-nobody-talks-about-839ad71324fe</link><guid isPermaLink="false">urn:sha256:73444373b3c88db6efacdbfabf55239d91e37af7c9d59e4f2523c5480b5e8fe6</guid><category>MEDIUM</category><chr2:sourceName>Medium</chr2:sourceName><chr2:firstObservedAtJST>2026-11-27T12:40:00.561159+09:00</chr2:firstObservedAtJST><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate><description>Forget the promises of becoming a cybersecurity expert in 90 days. Here is what actually matters when building a sustainable career. Continue reading on Medium »</description></item><item><title>既存の業務システムに、AI 用の「読む口」を足す — 権限を本人以下に保つ MCP サーバーの 5 つの約束（約 60 行）</title><link>https://qiita.com/mysin008/items/4aa5b62af304d30535f6</link><guid isPermaLink="false">urn:sha256:c9605319d82486364e705902ccad41387e180381685e32e931646b0bcc329e6f</guid><category>QIITA</category><chr2:sourceName>Qiita</chr2:sourceName><chr2:firstObservedAtJST>2026-11-27T12:40:00.561159+09:00</chr2:firstObservedAtJST><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:00:23 GMT</pubDate><description>社内の業務システムに AI をつなごうとすると、最初にだいたいこう聞かれます。 システムを作り直す必要があるの